WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.333
REau installation and Wi-Fi problems, and how to fix them

2
00:00:04.333 --> 00:00:14.067
1. Play Protect blocked the installation: pause app scanning in the Play Store, install the APK again and turn Play Protect back on

3
00:00:14.067 --> 00:00:22.533
2. Android Auto server off: open Android Auto settings and, in the three-dot menu, tap Start head unit server

4
00:00:22.533 --> 00:00:29.800
Restarted the phone? The server turns off: start it again by hand. REau connects by itself when it answers

5
00:00:29.800 --> 00:00:39.933
3. The menu doesn’t show Start server? Android Auto’s developer mode is off: tap Version ten times. The phone’s developer mode doesn’t count

6
00:00:39.933 --> 00:00:48.600
4. After Turn off, Android Auto takes up to a minute to close the previous session. Wait, or stop and start the server

7
00:00:48.600 --> 00:00:58.400
5. Android Auto not answering or with no picture: force stop it, then turn REau off and on. In Battery, set it to Unrestricted

8
00:00:58.400 --> 00:01:09.467
6. If REau warns that a VPN is holding it back: turn the VPN off or leave REau out of it, with split tunneling, and reconnect the VPN

9
00:01:09.467 --> 00:01:18.600
7. Dash Wi-Fi not found: check the bike’s key, the phone’s Wi-Fi and location and, in Bike data, the full network name

10
00:01:18.600 --> 00:01:24.067
If you changed bikes or there is more than one dash nearby, tap Forget and search again

11
00:01:24.067 --> 00:01:31.667
8. If you see Another app has the dash, stop the other app’s streaming to the dash. REau retries by itself

12
00:01:31.667 --> 00:01:37.867
The dash may have hung: switch the bike off with the key, wait about thirty seconds and switch it on again

13
00:01:37.867 --> 00:01:47.733
9. If the dash shows PICTURE STUCK or the app says No new picture, Android Auto stopped sending the picture. It usually comes back by itself

14
00:01:47.733 --> 00:01:54.933
10. If you turned on the network server, REau doesn’t look for the dash: turn that switch off to use the bike

15
00:01:54.933 --> 00:01:58.867
More answers are in REau’s frequently asked questions

